UID:26ef1c44e7914743227eba719da9@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The flavors of nine coastal communities\, all rolled up into o
 ne savory week. Newport Restaurant Week now takes place annually each fall
 \, the perfect setting for this well-seasoned event. So as you put away yo
 ur sandals and suits\, loosen your seersuckers and save your appetite for 
 10 days of crave worthy discounts and deals each fall. Join us for another
  season of Newport Restaurant Week from Friday\, November 6th to Sunday\, 
 November 15th. Participating restaurants\, menus and more to come.\n\nSour
 ce: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/newport-restaurant-week-2026/11
 2499/
LOCATION:Various Locations throughout Newport and Bristol Counties\, Vario
 us Locations Throughout Newport & Bristol Counties\, Newport\, RI 02840 Va
